and AUTHORS in the upstream archive, and is licensed under GPL version 3
or later. See https://www.gnu.org/software/gsl/ and COPYING.

orvara (Kepler solver)
======================

The trig-free Kepler solver in src/gaiamock/kepler_solve_astrometry.c
(kepler_orvara_table, kepler_cos_sin_orvara and helpers) is derived from
orvara (https://github.com/t-brandt/orvara; orvara/calcEA.h and orbit.pyx,
Brandt et al. 2021, AJ 162, 186), via its JAX port in harv
(https://github.com/adrn/harv, src/harv/kepler/_kepler_solver.py).
